#, c-format
msgid "Use GPU-specific compatibility toggles for %s hardware."
msgstr "Použite prepínače kompatibility špecifické pre hardvér %s."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:19
msgid "More options"
msgstr "Viac možností"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:22
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1243
msgid "vkBasalt visual effects"
msgstr "Vizuálne efekty vkBasalt"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:22
msgid "Adds visual effects like sharpening and color adjustments."
msgstr "Pridáva vizuálne efekty, ako je doostrenie a úprava farieb."

#. Proton & Wine compatibility
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:24
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1262
msgid "OpenGL fallback (WineD3D)"
msgstr "Záložný režim OpenGL (WineD3D)"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:25
msgid ""
"Uses OpenGL instead of Vulkan. Only enable if you're having DXVK issues."
msgstr ""
"Použije OpenGL namiesto Vulkanu. Zapínajte iba v prípade, že máte problémy s "
"DXVK."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:30
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1264
msgid "NTSync mode"
msgstr "Režim NTSync"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:31
msgid ""
"Uses FSync instead of NTSync. Can fix issues in certain games that do not "
"pair well with NTSync."
msgstr ""
"Použije FSync namiesto NTSync. Môže vyriešiť problémy v určitých hrách, "
"ktoré nefungujú správne s NTSync."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:36
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1237
msgid "Per-game shader cache"
msgstr "Vyrovnávacia pamäť shaderov pre každú hru"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:37
msgid ""
"Enables per-game shader cache. This isolates the shader cache of each game "
"but does not compile them ahead-of-time."
msgstr ""
"Povolí vyrovnávaciu pamäť shaderov pre každú hru zvlášť. Izoluje to pamäť "
"pre každú hru, ale nekompiluje ich vopred."

#. Input & audio
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:41
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1313
msgid "Prefer SDL controller input"
msgstr "Uprednostniť vstup ovládača cez SDL"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:41
msgid "Workaround for controller detection issues."
msgstr "Obchádzka (workaround) pre problémy s detekciou ovládačov."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:43
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1314
msgid "Bypass Steam Input"
msgstr "Obísť Steam Input"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:44
msgid "Disables Steam Input support. Fixes Wayland controller/gamepad issues."
msgstr ""
"Zakáže podporu Steam Input. Opravuje problémy s ovládačmi/gamepadmi na "
"Waylande."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:48
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1268
msgid "Vulkan synchronization 2"
msgstr "Synchronizácia Vulkan 2"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:49
msgid ""
"Enables WINE_VK_USE_SYNC2 which can improve performance and reduce "
"stuttering in some games when using WineD3D."
msgstr ""
"Povolí premennú WINE_VK_USE_SYNC2, ktorá pri použití WineD3D môže v "
"niektorých hrách zvýšiť výkon a znížiť sekanie."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:53
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1269
msgid "Futex waitv synchronization"
msgstr "Synchronizácia futex waitv"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:54
msgid ""
"Enables WINE_SYNC_USE_FUTEX_WAITV which can improve performance and reduce "
"stuttering in some games when using WineD3D."
msgstr ""
"Povolí premennú WINE_SYNC_USE_FUTEX_WAITV, ktorá pri použití WineD3D môže v "
"niektorých hrách zvýšiť výkon a znížiť sekanie."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:58
msgid "Simulate Write-Copy Memory"
msgstr "Simulovať pamäť Write-Copy"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:59
msgid ""
"Forces Wine to simulate page-write protection, fixing initialization errors "
"in certain older titles."
msgstr ""
"Vynúti vo Wine simuláciu ochrany zápisu stránok pamäte, čím opraví chyby "
"inicializácie v niektorých starších tituloch."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:18
msgid "Proton options"
msgstr "Možnosti Protonu"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:19
msgid "Extra Proton settings and launch behaviors."
msgstr "Dodatočné nastavenia Protonu a správanie pri spustení."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:22
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1236
msgid "High process priority"
msgstr "Vysoká priorita procesu"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:23
msgid ""
"Gives the game a higher CPU priority which can improve performance in some "
"cases."
msgstr ""
"Pridelí hre vyššiu prioritu CPU, čo v niektorých prípadoch môže zlepšiť "
"výkon."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:27
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1266
msgid "WoW64 mode"
msgstr "Režim WoW64"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:28
msgid ""
"Enables WoW64 support for 32-bit games on 64-bit Proton builds. This can "
"improve compatibility for some older games."
msgstr ""
"Povolí podporu WoW64 pre 32-bitové hry v 64-bitových zostaveniach Protonu. "
"Môže to zlepšiť kompatibilitu starších hier."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:32
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1265
msgid "Large address awareness for 32-bit games"
msgstr "Large address awareness pre 32-bitové hry"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:33
msgid ""
"Forces 32-bit games to use large address aware which can improve performance "
"and stability."
msgstr ""
"Vynúti pre 32-bitové hry príznak „large address aware“, čo môže zvýšiť výkon "
"a stabilitu."

#. Diagnostics & raw command
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:37
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1328
msgid "Proton debug log"
msgstr "Ladiaci log Protonu"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:38
msgid ""
"Enables logging for Proton which can help with troubleshooting game issues. "
"Logs are saved in the game's compatibility data folder."
msgstr ""
"Povolí vytváranie logov pre Proton, čo pomáha pri riešení problémov s hrami. "
"Logy sa ukladajú do zložky s dátami kompatibility danej hry."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:42
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1270
msgid "OptiScaler integration"
msgstr "Integrácia OptiScaler"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:43
msgid ""
"Enables the Proton OptiScaler which can improve performance and image "
"quality for some games (Available from version 11-1)."
msgstr ""
"Povolí Proton OptiScaler, ktorý môže v niektorých hrách zlepšiť výkon a "
"kvalitu obrazu (dostupné od verzie 11-1)."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:47
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1271
msgid "Discord bridge"
msgstr "Discord bridge"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:48
msgid ""
"Enables the Proton Discord Bridge which can improve integration with Discord "
"for some games (Available from version 11-1)."
msgstr ""
"Povolí Proton Discord Bridge, ktorý môže v niektorých hrách zlepšiť "
"integráciu s Discordom (dostupné od verzie 11-1)."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:52
msgid "Use D7VK"
msgstr "Použiť D7VK"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:53
msgid ""
"Enables the use of D7VK which can improve performance and compatibility for "
"some Direct3D 9 games (Available from version 11-1)."
msgstr ""
"Povolí použitie D7VK, ktoré môže v niektorých hrách s Direct3D 9 zlepšiť "
"výkon a kompatibilitu (dostupné od verzie 11-1)."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:14
msgid "VKD3D options"
msgstr "Možnosti VKD3D"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:21
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:65
msgid "Configure Direct3D 12 to Vulkan translation behavior"
msgstr "Nastaviť správanie prekladu Direct3D 12 na Vulkan"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:27
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-log-level.vala:21
msgid "VKD3D Logging Level"
msgstr "Úroveň logovania VKD3D"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:30
msgid "Enable VKD3D GPUVA"
msgstr "Povoliť VKD3D GPUVA"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:31
msgid ""
"Enables GPU Virtual Addressing. Aligns Vulkan memory management with native "
"DX12 behavior to improve texture streaming and stability in open-world games."
msgstr ""
"Povolí GPU Virtual Addressing. Zladí správu pamäte Vulkanu s natívnym "
"správaním DX12 pre lepší streaming textúr a stabilitu v open-world hrách."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:36
msgid "Enable VKD3D Shader Cache"
msgstr "Povoliť cache shaderov VKD3D"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:37
msgid ""
"Enables VKD3D's internal shader caching mechanism to minimize in-game "
"stutter."
msgstr ""
"Povolí interný mechanizmus vyrovnávacej pamäte shaderov vo VKD3D, aby sa "
"minimalizovalo sekanie v hre."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:41
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1281
msgid "Proton-CachyOS DX12 low latency"
msgstr "Proton-CachyOS nízka latencia DX12"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:42
msgid ""
"Uses Reflex markers or waitable swapchains. Intel GPUs and frame generation "
"are unsupported."
msgstr ""
"Použije markery Reflex alebo čakateľné swapchainy. GPU Intel a generovanie "
"snímok nie sú podporované."

#. Display & launch tools
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/wrapper-group.vala:19
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1240
msgid "Launch backend"
msgstr "Backend spustenia"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/wrapper-group.vala:20
msgid ""
"Choose System default, Gamescope, or ScopeBuddy for display and launch "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte predvolený systémový režim, Gamescope alebo ScopeBuddy pre "
"zobrazenie a možnosti spustenia."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/wrapper-group.vala:46
msgid "System default"
msgstr "Predvolený systém"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/wrapper-group.vala:49
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1248
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1249
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1250
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1251
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1252
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1253
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:436
msgid "Gamescope"
msgstr "Gamescope"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/wrapper-group.vala:54
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1254
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1255
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1256
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1257
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1258
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-option-catalog.vala:1259
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:439
msgid "ScopeBuddy"
msgstr "ScopeBuddy"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:214
msgid "This option is unsupported and cannot be newly enabled."
msgstr "Táto možnosť nie je podporovaná a nemožno ju novo zapnúť."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:221
msgid "This legacy option is preserved but cannot be newly enabled."
msgstr "Táto staršia možnosť je zachovaná, ale nie je možné ju novo zapnúť."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:225
msgid "Compatibility-tool capabilities are not known yet."
msgstr "Možnosti nástroja kompatibility ešte nie sú známe."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:242
msgid "Requires an available launch backend."
msgstr "Vyžaduje dostupný backend spustenia."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:250
msgid "Requires a compatible Proton variant."
msgstr "Vyžaduje kompatibilný variant Protonu."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:267
msgid "The selected launch backend is not supported."
msgstr "Vybraný backend spustenia nie je podporovaný."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:345
msgid "Requires an AMD GPU."
msgstr "Vyžaduje AMD GPU."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:346
msgid "Requires an NVIDIA GPU."
msgstr "Vyžaduje NVIDIA GPU."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:347
msgid "Requires an Intel GPU."
msgstr "Vyžaduje Intel GPU."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:348
msgid "Requires MangoHud, which is not available."
msgstr "Vyžaduje MangoHud, ktorý nie je dostupný."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:349
msgid "Requires GameMode, which is not available."
msgstr "Vyžaduje GameMode, ktorý nie je dostupný."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:350
msgid "Requires the CachyOS game-performance command, which is not available."
msgstr "Vyžaduje príkaz CachyOS game-performance, ktorý nie je dostupný."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:351
msgid "Requires obs-vkcapture, which is not available."
msgstr "Vyžaduje obs-vkcapture, ktorý nie je dostupný."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:352
msgid "Requires Gamescope, which is not available."
msgstr "Vyžaduje Gamescope, ktorý nie je dostupný."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:353
msgid "Requires ScopeBuddy, which is not available."
msgstr "Vyžaduje ScopeBuddy, ktorý nie je dostupný."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:354
msgid "Requires vkBasalt, which is not available."
msgstr "Vyžaduje vkBasalt, ktorý nie je dostupný."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:355
msgid "Requires DXVK from the selected compatibility tool."
msgstr "Vyžaduje DXVK z vybraného nástroja kompatibility."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:356
msgid "Requires VKD3D-Proton from the selected compatibility tool."
msgstr "Vyžaduje VKD3D-Proton z vybraného nástroja kompatibility."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:357
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:367
msgid "Not supported by the selected compatibility tool."
msgstr "Vybraný nástroj kompatibility to nepodporuje."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:358
msgid ""
"The selected Proton build does not advertise legacy PROTON_ENABLE_HDR "
"support."
msgstr ""
"Vybraný build Protonu neuvádza podporu staršieho prepínača PROTON_ENABLE_HDR."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:359
msgid ""
"The selected Proton build does not advertise automatic-HDR opt-out support."
msgstr ""
"Vybraný build Protonu neuvádza podporu vypnutia automatic-HDR (opt-out)."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:360
msgid ""
"The selected Proton build does not advertise PROTON_FSR4_UPGRADE support."
msgstr "Vybraný build Protonu neuvádza podporu PROTON_FSR4_UPGRADE."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:361
msgid ""
"The selected Proton build does not advertise the legacy RDNA3 FSR 4 switch."
msgstr "Vybraný build Protonu neuvádza starší prepínač RDNA3 FSR 4."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:362
msgid ""
"The selected Proton build does not advertise PROTON_MLFG_UPGRADE support."
msgstr "Vybraný build Protonu neuvádza podporu PROTON_MLFG_UPGRADE."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:363
msgid ""
"The selected Proton build does not advertise its DXVK low-latency option."
msgstr "Vybraný build Protonu neuvádza svoju nízkolatenčnú voľbu DXVK."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:364
msgid ""
"The selected Proton build does not advertise its VKD3D-Proton low-latency "
"option."
msgstr "Vybraný build Protonu neuvádza svoju nízkolatenčnú voľbu VKD3D-Proton."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:365
msgid ""
"The selected Proton build does not advertise the low-latency Vulkan layer."
msgstr "Vybraný build Protonu neuvádza nízkolatenčnú vrstvu Vulkanu."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-option-capability-resolver.vala:366
msgid "The selected Proton build does not advertise its Vulkan Reflex layer."
msgstr "Vybraný build Protonu neuvádza svoju vrstvu Vulkan Reflex."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:11
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:11
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:26
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Zapnuté"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:15
msgid ""
"Validates the compiler's internal representation after each pass. Used for "
"driver debugging."
msgstr ""
"Overuje internú reprezentáciu kompilátora po každom priechode. Používa sa na "
"ladenie ovládača."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:16
msgid ""
"Disables FP gathering optimizations. Workaround for specific texture issues "
"in older games."
msgstr ""
"Vypne optimalizácie FP gathering. Obídenie problému pre konkrétne problémy s "
"textúrami v starších hrách."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:17
msgid ""
"Prints detailed compilation performance stats and register usage to system "
"log."
msgstr ""
"Vypíše do systémového logu podrobné štatistiky výkonu kompilácie a využitia "
"registrov."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:18
msgid ""
"Forces the use of the instruction selector pass even when it could be "
"bypassed."
msgstr ""
"Vynúti použitie priechodu instruction selector, aj keď by sa dal obísť."

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:19
msgid ""
"Disables the instruction scheduling pass. Can help isolate compiler bugs."
